  "releaseNotes": "### macOS Reliability\n\n- Give Pudding's Electron app and helper executables distinct, reproducible UUIDs while preserving the existing app identity and signing chain. Record the upstream UUIDs for release verification and crash-symbol lookup.\n\n### Conversation Experience\n\n- Improve header and sidebar spacing, let Markdown tables use the available width, and keep recent workspace items accessible in compact windows.\n- Clear stale turn activity when a completed, failed, or cancelled turn appears in saved conversation history, including when its final event arrives late or is missed.\n\n### Compatibility\n\n- Continue using schema version 24 with no database migration from Pudding 0.3.7. Minimum macOS versions remain 14.0 for Apple Silicon and 15.5 for Intel.",
